# Window Tilier - Button Definitions
# Left: Up, Down, Left, Right (directional snap)
# Right: Close, Minimize, Maximize

# ============================================================
# COLOR SCHEME
# ============================================================
Colorset 10 fg #ffffff, bg #2980b9, bgHFocus #1a5276, fgHFocus #ffffff
Colorset 11 fg #ffffff, bg #c0392b, bgHFocus #e74c3c, fgHFocus #ffffff
Colorset 12 fg #bdc3c7, bg #2c3e50, bgHFocus #34495e, fgHFocus #ecf0f1

# Active title
TitleStyle ActiveColorset 10
TitleStyle ActiveDecorationColorset 10
TitleStyle ActiveButtonColorset 10

# Inactive title
TitleStyle InactiveColorset 12
TitleStyle InactiveDecorationColorset 12
TitleStyle InactiveButtonColorset 12

# ============================================================
# TITLE BAR LAYOUT
# ============================================================
TitleStyle Height 30
TitleStyle Centered
TitleStyle MinimumWidth 100
TitleStyle ActiveFont "xft:Noto Sans:size=10:bold"
TitleStyle InactiveFont "xft:Noto Sans:size=9"
TitleStyle ActiveForeground #ffffff
TitleStyle InactiveForeground #bdc3c7
TitleStyle ActiveBackground #2980b9
TitleStyle InactiveBackground #2c3e50

# Border
TitleStyle LeftEdge 2
TitleStyle RightEdge 2
TitleStyle TopEdge 2
TitleStyle BottomEdge 2

# ============================================================
# PIXMAPS FOR BUTTONS (using built-in symbols with text labels)
# ============================================================
# We use MiniIcons for custom buttons since FVVM supports icon paths

# ---- RIGHT SIDE BUTTONS ----
# Close button
Style * CloseButtonPixmap close_icon.xpm
Style * CloseButtonLeftPixmap close_icon.xpm
Style * CloseButtonRightPixmap close_icon.xpm

# Minimize button
Style * IconifyButtonPixmap minimize_icon.xpm
Style * IconifyButtonLeftPixmap minimize_icon.xpm
Style * IconifyButtonRightPixmap minimize_icon.xpm

# Maximize button
Style * MaximizeButtonPixmap maximize_icon.xpm
Style * MaximizeButtonLeftPixmap maximize_icon.xpm
Style * MaximizeButtonRightPixmap maximize_icon.xpm

# ============================================================
# BUTTON ORDER IN TITLE BAR
# ============================================================
# FVVM button indices:
#  -1 = Left-justified spacer
#   0 = Right-justified spacer
#   1 = Menu button
#   2 = Minimize/Iconify
#   3 = Maximize
#   4 = Close (but index 6 is also close)
#   5 = Shade (also 8)
#   6 = Close
#   7 = ?
#
# We use TitleButtonOrderLeft and TitleButtonOrderRight

# Left buttons (directional snap - we use custom pixmaps via AddButton)
# Right buttons (standard window controls)
TitleButtonOrderLeft  -1
TitleButtonOrderRight 6 2 3

# ============================================================
# CUSTOM SNAP BUTTONS ON THE LEFT
# ============================================================
# We add custom buttons using AddButton style and function bindings
# FVVM doesn't have a simple "add text button" - we use pixmaps.
# Since we can't easily create XPM files here, we'll use FvwmButtons
# as a title bar module.

# Alternative: Use mouse bindings on the title bar corners
# for quick tiling actions.

# Actually let's use the built-in buttons with custom meanings:
# Button 5 (shade) -> Snap Up
# Button 8 (shade alt) -> Snap Down
# Button 1 (menu) -> Snap Left
# We remap with SendToModule

# Better approach: Use FvwmEvent to add title actions
